{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And he shall take out.</b> To take out the ashes. No priest is written here — this teaches that priests with blemishes are fit to take out the ashes." "<b>To a pure place.</b> Since they come from a place of holiness. But concerning afflicted stones it writes ״to an impure place״ — meaning, a place where those bearing pure offerings do not normally go there."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:10:09.659545994Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}